title Spike 14: an economy each
about Two against two, each player with their own metal and energy. Blue's first player feeds the second: 400 metal every 20 seconds. Red doesn't share. 4 minutes at 8x.

scenario economy
players blue 2
players red 2
clip 0..7200
speed 8
camera 256,256 400

at 900 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 1500 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 2100 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 2700 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 3300 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 3900 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 4500 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 5100 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 5700 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 6300 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1
at 6900 give blue.0 metal 400 to 1

# Observed: at 900, 400 metal moves (blue.0 406 -> 7, blue.1 430 -> 830); at
# 3600 blue.0 has only 20 to 45, and only that moves. By 7200 blue.1 has 46 units to
# blue.0's 30; red, stalled on metal, is down to 9 and has lost 93.
at 901 expect blue.0 metal < 50
at 901 expect blue.1 metal >= 800
at 3601 expect blue.0 metal < 50
at 7200 expect blue.1 units >= 30
at 7200 expect blue.0 units >= 15
at 7200 expect red units <= 25
at 7200 expect red lost >= 50
